      },
      "message": "New covering arrays of strength 3 and 4\n\nSeven covering arrays below the November 2024 snapshot of Colbourn's\ntables. Strength 3: CA(165;3,7,5), CA(165;3,8,5), CA(218;3,11,5),\nCA(476;3,10,7), CA(556;3,11,7) and CA(633;3,12,7). Strength 4:\nCA(129;4,8,3).\n\nIncluded: the checkers with run_all.sh and logs (three for the\nstrength-3 arrays, two for the strength-4 array), negative controls,\nevery certified intermediate array of the v=7 searches, the\nconstructions (the extension lemma behind the 218 with its proof, the\nAGL(1,5) starters of the 165, the AGL(1,3) starters of the 129, the\ntabu search program) and the k=13 argument for linear and\ndoubling-shaped arrays.",
